    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630420/extras/87a4e0eb3d1330c6d64a5371e0f05d32.webp?t=1737632919\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630420/extras/efe3c085339a06eecc0b171cace8fd5a.poster.avif?t=1737632919\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630420/extras/efe3c085339a06eecc0b171cace8fd5a.webm?t=1737632919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, long ago, a multitude of races and species lived on the land. However, the struggle for survival was real, and conflict and disputes were inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil, heartless Undead used forbidden black magic from ancient times to create strange beasts and freaks, plunging the already war-torn continent into an even deeper hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, the dark claw of evil reaches the Misty Forest, a northern territory and home of the Elven race. Play as the great Elven guardian Lina to protect the Elven queen, the soon-to-be-born princess, and the honor of the Elves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2630420/extras/a10af86bc8cffbb3b5bdf7bed2e6257a.poster.avif?t=1737632919\" width=616 height=952 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai